<title>FRANCE: EU rejects bids to sell German intervention rye.</title>
<headline>EU rejects bids to sell German intervention rye.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday rejected all bids to export German intervention rye to non-EU countries, member-country officials said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
